50:Malcolm: We're screwed:5_00144
51:Malcolm: Maybe with the right tactics:5_00155... No... It won't work anyway:5_00133 Our army is too small:5_00133
52:Malcolm: Yes:5_00141. What a relief, I'm already hungry:5_00138. I hope they have some food:5_00150

53:GAME: Upgrade people, upgrade:5_00134. Have you ever wondered why I sometimes help you in different ways? :5_00155

54:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Nice to see you again, Malcolm. 
55:Malcolm: And the same to you, auntie:5_00156
56:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: Auntie?
57:[$09F641]Stranger[$ffffff]: So you two know each other?
58:Malcolm: Yes. Iris is my ward.
59:[$09F641]Stranger[$ffffff]: Is Iris your mother?
60:Malcolm: If she were my mother, I'd say, mother, mom :5_00140
61:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: Wait a minute:5_00155. You never mentioned knowing the fortune teller personally. And the fact that she raised you is beyond me:5_00145
62:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Some things aren't and shouldn't be spoken of.
63:Malcolm: Exactly, and who is that woman next to you:5_00136?
64:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: I am Attila. Daughter of Karion, rightful heir to the throne of Valtaria.
65:Malcolm: So you are the lost princess of the King of Valtaria:5_00136, or rather, the former king:5_00138.
66:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: Yes. I'm preparing to finally reveal myself.
67:Malcolm: Why didn't you do this sooner:5_00155?
68:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Because I found her two years ago. She was imprisoned on Carthage, and by Kregor.
69:Malcolm: Your own brother imprisoned you:5_00155?
70:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: Just to gain power in Valtaria.
71:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: Let's get back to the matter at hand:5_00140. The Grand Inquisition is guarding Citland. The city won't do anything without their consent:5_00145.
72:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: And who exactly sent them?
73:Malcolm: Kregor:5_00145 It's like his, extra-Valtarian army. It steps in and conquers for him.
74:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: That explains everything, he's afraid to come out. When he's in power, he uses others, that's how it's always been.
75:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: That's why we have the advantage :5_00150
76:Malcolm: Hey, stop doing that :5_00146?
77:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: What? Are you jealous :5_00150?? You're not the only one who can use emoticons left and right :5_00150:5_00150:5_00151
78:Malcolm: Ehhh, never mind :5_00145
79:Malcolm: Auntie. Dyron is moving on Darin. He was going to meet you. I hope the Tribe of Destillon won't harm him.
80:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: They won't kill anyone without my permission. Did he leave long ago?
81:Malcolm: A few days ago.
82:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Then I must go. You, my children, try to recover what belongs to you.
83:Malcolm: So what have you been doing for two years? :5_00150 :5_00136
84:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: I trained. I'm a specialized crossbowman. I can hit any target. However, I'm weak at close range defense. 85:Malcolm: Up close, I can protect you :5_00150
86:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: What kind of closeness are you talking about?:5_00150
87:Malcolm: As close as you'll let me :5_00150:5_00136:5_00134
88:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: Oh my gosh:5_00154 Okay, lovebirds. Let's retake Citland, and then you can kiss each other:5_00140.
89:Malcolm: Do you have a plan?:5_00155
90:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: I always have a plan:5_00150. Do you have another army in those tunnels? 
91:Malcolm: There is something, yea:5_00134.
92:GAME: In the next mission, watch out for ships.